  {
   "type": "text",
   "title": "How to read this",
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Pick the deployment with **namespace** (`ethereum-<id>`; `obol network list`). Each panel is labelled with the client container (e.g. `reth`, `lighthouse`). Clients name their metrics differently; panels combine the per-client names with `or`. Where only some clients expose a signal the panel says which. For a live verdict from the node APIs run `obol network status`."
   },
   "id": 1,
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 3,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   }
  },
